  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-heading">2 Why use an Effluent Flow Monitoring System</h2>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <p>Any plant that has to discharge liquid waste needs to prove to the relevant authorities the chemical content and volume discharged.</p>
      <p>In the system illustrated (above), a sample is taken every 50m³ of effluent and the pH of that sample is recorded along with the flowrate.</p>
      <p>The sample is pumped into a collecting jar to allow further analysis. To avoid cross contamination, the sampling system is automatically purged at regular intervals.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">3 Why use ABB Instrumentation</h2>
